:null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2693483721","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103468#issuecomment-2693483721","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103468","id":2693483721,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gi0zJ","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-03T07:20:08Z","updated_at":"2025-03-03T07:20:08Z","body":"My worry is if you start explaining too much about UIDs in the upgrade dialog, and we have a cancel button, the users are going to say \"oh this is too complicated, I don't want this UID stuff\" and hit cancel, not knowing that the UIDs are there regardless and the dialog is just to facilitate the transition.\r\n\r\nWe could have some \"What's new?\" popup that just has an OK button and explains some of the changes related to UIDs.\r\nBut also, if a user sees a \"what's new\" dialog, they will probably mash OK without reading it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2693483721/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0